Salate Browser Project Analysis Report
Here is the complete end-to-end analysis of your Flutter project Salate-Browser.

1. Project Overview
Salate Browser is a custom mobile web browser built with Flutter. It features a personalized home page with a clock, weather updates, and shortcuts to popular services (Google apps, AI tools). It supports multiple tabs, browsing history, and basic extension injection (JavaScript).

The app aims to be a privacy-focused ("Fast. Private. Yours.") browser with a modern aesthetic, including dark mode support and animated UI elements.

